ksTFL as a whole is distributed under the GPL-3 license.

This source package also redistributes the following third-party components
under licenses that are compatible with GPL-3:

* `src/vendor/freetype` contains selected source files from FreeType 2.13.3.
  FreeType is dual-licensed under the FreeType License and GPL-2.0-or-later.
  ksTFL redistributes the vendored files under the FreeType License option.
  Upstream copyright and license notices are retained in the vendored source
  tree.

* `src/vendor/harfbuzz` contains selected source files from HarfBuzz 10.2.0.
  HarfBuzz is distributed under its upstream permissive license. Upstream
  copyright and license notices are retained in the vendored source tree.

* `src/vendor/minizip` contains the ZIP-writing subset of minizip from zlib
  1.3.1. The vendored minizip files are distributed under the zlib license.
  Upstream copyright and license notices are retained in the vendored source
  files.

* `src/vendor/nlohmann/json.hpp` contains nlohmann/json 3.12.0 under the MIT
  license. The bundled header also carries upstream notices for incorporated
  third-party code, including Apache License 2.0 text references for Abseil
  fragments and MIT-licensed notices for other incorporated sources, as
  documented in the header itself.

* `inst/fonts` contains bundled Liberation Sans, Liberation Serif, and
  Liberation Mono font files. These fonts are distributed under the SIL Open
  Font License 1.1. A copy of the OFL text is provided in `inst/fonts/OFL.txt`.

The vendored third-party code and bundled fonts remain under their original
licenses; this note documents their redistribution within the GPL-3 ksTFL
package.